      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1288s1d">
        <bpmn:text>Pre-Condition: configs/dim_location_config.yaml disponível.
Input: URLs (CAOP, NUTS, IGEOE, WFS).
Descrição: Descarrega fontes, gera checksum, valida licença e extrai para formato canónico.
Output: data/raw_admin/validated/&lt;source&gt;.gpkg, logs/download_admin.log, *_metadata.json.
Post-Condition: Artefactos raw e validados prontos para processamento.</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="Association_1h0mgxj" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_0nob6lg" targetRef="TextAnnotation_1288s1d" />
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1plbkzn">
        <bpmn:text>Pre-Condition: Artefactos validados em data/raw_admin/validated/.
Input: data/raw_admin/validated/*.gpkg.
Descrição: Reprojeta para EPSG:4326, corrige geometrias (makevalid) e harmoniza campos.
Output: data/processing/admin_enriched.gpkg.
Post-Condition: Layer canónico com geometria e esquema consistentes.</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="Association_1ldwfh6" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_074l4qp" targetRef="TextAnnotation_1plbkzn" />
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0yv68bp">
        <bpmn:text>Pre-Condition: admin_enriched.gpkg existe.
Input: admin_enriched.gpkg, configs/aggregation_spec.yaml.
Descrição: Calcula centroides, área, bbox e cria grid/unidades de agregação.
Output: admin_enriched_with_centroids.gpkg, aggregation_units.gpkg.
Post-Condition: Unidades de análise prontas para interseções.</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="Association_08grgp0" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_0ij7m97" targetRef="TextAnnotation_0yv68bp" />
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0e7cew3">
        <bpmn:text>Pre-Condition: aggregation_units.gpkg e admin_enriched_with_centroids.gpkg criados.
Input: aggregation_units.gpkg, admin_enriched_with_centroids.gpkg.
Descrição: Interseta unidades com polígonos administrativos; atribui distrito/município/freguesia (área-ponderada) e marca não coincidentes.
Output: location_lookup.gpkg, reports/unmatched_report.csv.
Post-Condition: Unidades com campos administrativos atribuídos; não coincidentes sinalizados.</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="Association_10iwl7m" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_1ta9z5w" targetRef="TextAnnotation_0e7cew3" />
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1galod5">
        <bpmn:text>Pre-Condition: location_lookup.gpkg contém unmatched.
Input: location_lookup.gpkg, reports/unmatched_report.csv.
Descrição: Tenta resolução automática (buffer, nearest neighbour, snap); gera lista para revisão manual.
Output: location_lookup_resolved.gpkg, reports/unmatched_manual_review.csv.
Post-Condition: Maioria resolvida; restantes para remediação.</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="Association_1uj9ocy" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_1ykss89" targetRef="TextAnnotation_1galod5" />
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0vjr6gt">
        <bpmn:text>Pre-Condition: location_lookup_resolved.gpkg pronto; DEM/CORINE disponíveis.
Input: location_lookup_resolved.gpkg, data/dem/*.tif, corine.gpkg, nuts.gpkg.
Descrição: Amostra DEM (altitude), calcula slope, marca urban_flag, atribui NUTS3.
Output: location_enriched.gpkg.
Post-Condition: Localizações enriquecidas com atributos derivados.</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="Association_02vmyfx" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_0mzoc6j" targetRef="TextAnnotation_0vjr6gt" />
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0qv95xe">
        <bpmn:text>Pre-Condition: location_enriched.gpkg criado.
Input: location_enriched.gpkg.
Descrição: Checks automáticos: geometria válida, centroid dentro do polígono, campos obrigatórios preenchidos, thresholds de área.
Output: reports/dim_location_qa.csv, reports/dim_location_exceptions.csv.
Post-Condition: QA concluído; exceções listadas.</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="Association_1aenwls" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_09t0b3s" targetRef="TextAnnotation_0qv95xe" />
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_0fgwjuk">
        <bpmn:text>Pre-Condition: QA OK ou exceções justificadas.
Input: location_enriched.gpkg, reports/dim_location_qa.csv, sql/dim_location_ddl.sql.
Descrição: Gerar provenance.json, README de deploy e resumo QA; registar versão no CHANGELOG.
Output: docs/dim_location_provenance.json, docs/dim_location_README.md.
Post-Condition: Artefacto documentado e rastreável.</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="Association_15t2ofc" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_1nxad5g" targetRef="TextAnnotation_0fgwjuk" />
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="TextAnnotation_1p0ysi1">
        <bpmn:text>Pre-Condition: Documentação pronta e QA OK.
Input: location_enriched.gpkg, sql/dim_location_ddl.sql, docs/dim_location_provenance.json.
Descrição: Carrega DSA.Integration.dim_location (bulk/merge), cria índices e grava versão em DSA.Metadata.
Output: DSA.Integration.dim_location, data/delivery/dim_location.gpkg, registo de versão.
Post-Condition: Dimensão disponível para consulta e BI.</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="Association_0q7q4ox" associationDirection="None" sourceRef="Activity_02vjg06" targetRef="TextAnnotation_1p0ysi1" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
